            filteredCount++;
        }
    }
    if(filteredCount == 0) {
        return 0; // no ratings with credibility score of at least 5
    }
    for(int i = 0; i < filteredCount; i++) {
        sum += filteredRatings[i];
    }
    return sum / filteredCount;
}
```
The modification includes adding an `if` statement to check if there are any ratings with a credibility score of at least 5. If there are no ratings with a credibility score of at least 5, the function returns 0. This modification ensures that the function does not divide by 0 when calculating the average rating.

